# Format before saving / completing changes

1. `.vscode/settings.json` enables `editor.formatOnSave`, trims trailing whitespace, inserts a final newline, and uses LF (`files.eol`).
2. `.editorconfig` mirrors the same defaults for editors that support it.
3. `.gitattributes` keeps tracked text files normalized to LF in git.

Before finishing edits, ensure touched `*.cfg`, `*.md`, `*.mdc`, `*.ini`, repo `*.json`, and `*.yml` / `*.yaml` files have no intentional trailing whitespace and end with a single newline. Do not commit CRLF-only files unless a format exception is documented.
